fastlio_ICP建图方法——回环：
打开雷达：wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/livox_ws$ ros2 launch livox_ros_driver2 msg_MID360_launch.py
回环建图：wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ ros2 launch pgo pgo_launch.py
保存地图：wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ ros2 service call /pgo/save_maps interface/srv/SaveMaps "{file_path: '/home/wang/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP/PCD/map2', save_patches: true}"


重定位启动教程：
 启动mid360——
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/livox_ws$ ros2 launch livox_ros_driver2 msg_MID360_launch.py
  
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ source install/setup.bash
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ ros2 launch localizer localizer_launch.py
  新开终端——
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ source install/setup.bash
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ ros2 service call /localizer/relocalize interface/srv/Relocalize "{pcd_path: '/home/wang/MID360_Project/fastlio_ws/PCD/map4.pcd'}"

  订阅话题——
  wang@wang:~/MID360_Project/fastlio_ICP$ ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo map lidar

	
